WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:05.255
Everyone,
we have a lovely flower girl here.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:07.799
A guest of my daughter.

00:00:07.882 --> 00:00:09.384
Ah, a flower girl.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:12.762
-There's Marnie.
-She'll be pretty like her mother.

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:16.433
May I please have one of those flowers?

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:19.060
My mother.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:30.363
Hello, my dear little witch.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:34.367
That woman there is the real witch.

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:38.204
Um...

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:47.047
I want only one, for good luck.

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:51.760
Will someone kindly pay for my flower?

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:56.765
If it is the witch's command...

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.267
Then I'll have one, too.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.936
-Here.
-For superb luck.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.317
Ah, it's begun.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.698
I'm sorry!

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:14.699
Oh, she ran away.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.926
Come on and take one for good luck!

00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:34.260
May I have one, please?

